q2.text:
Which vector diagram correctly shows the force Z as the resultant of forces X and Y?
[Four right-angled vector diagrams:
A: side X pointing up, bottom side Y pointing right, hypotenuse Z pointing up-left;
B: side X pointing up, bottom side Y pointing right, hypotenuse Z pointing down-right;
C: side X pointing up, top side Y pointing right, hypotenuse Z pointing down-left;
D: side X pointing up, top side Y pointing right, hypotenuse Z pointing up-right from the base of X to the end of Y]
